    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo 13 Dangan, Kilmacow is an excellent four bedroomed two bath detached bungalow situated in a mature cul de sac of just eighteen similar type detached family homes in the popular area of Dangan, Kilmacow.\nThe property comprises of entrance porch, entrance hall, sitting room, open plan kitchen / dining / living room, utility with wc, four spacious bedrooms, newly fitted main bathroom and detached garage.\nThe property has the benefit of oil fired central heating, uPVC double glazing windows and pvc facia & soffits.\n\nLOCATION\nKilmacow is a popular and well-established South Kilkenny village with a strong community and an excellent range of everyday amenities. These include primary schooling, local shops and services, a community centre and extensive sporting and recreational facilities. Kilmacow Sports Complex provides GAA, soccer, athletics and tennis facilities together with a children's playground, while the River Blackwater and surrounding countryside provide attractive opportunities for walking and outdoor recreation. \n\nThe location combines the benefits of village living with excellent accessibility to Waterford City. Kilmacow is approximately 9.5 km from Waterford City, which is convenient for those working in the city while wishing to enjoy a more relaxed village environment. The M9 Motorway is readily accessible, providing excellent connectivity towards Kilkenny City, Dublin and the wider national road network, while Waterford and the wider South-East are also easily reached."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.50 x 0.52\nTiled flooring\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.87 x 2.69\nCarpet flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 4.76 x 3.73\nCarpet flooring. Open fireplace with marble surround. Curtians to windows.\n\nKitchen/Dining room - 6.73 x 4.70\nLinoleum flooring. Fitted kitchen with integrated oven and hob, dishwasher and fridge. Blinds to windows. Free standing wood burning stove.\n\nUtility Room - 3.95 x 1.85\nLinoleum flooring. Fitted units with sink. Plumbed for washing machine.\n\nShower Room - 0.80 x 1.82\nTiled floor and walls to ceiling. WC, WHB and T90 shower.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.44 x 3.06\nSolid timber flooring. Fitted wardrobes. Curtains in window.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.82 x 3.03\nCarpet flooring. Fitted wardrobes. Curtains to window.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.91 x 3.62\nCarpet flooring. Curtains to window.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.43 x 3.62\nCarpet flooring. Curtains to window. Fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 1.78 x 3.60\nTiled floor and walls to ceiling. WC, WHB with vanity unit. Walk in shower and Bath. Recess lighting. Blind to window.\n\n"
      },
      {
